infinite-patch 1
# turbo-mod-range
node 1 Compositing Comment
  uid 1
  pos 0 0
  flags 1 0 0 0 1 0
  s text ATTRIBUTE POINTZ - tutorial\n\nWrites one attribute on every point: a number, a vector or a colour. Add it from the node menu: PointZ > Attribute PointZ. Plug any PointZ in, and what comes out is the same points with that attribute set.\n\nSettings\n- attribute: the name to write. P (position), N (normal), Color, PScale (size), Scale (size per axis), Rotate (degrees), Tex (uv), PartVel... or a new name of your own (Height, Mask).\n- components: 1 = one number, 2 / 3 / 4 = a vector (x y z w = r g b a).\n- value: where it comes from -\n   constant: 'value' (and 'value (4th)' for the 4th component)\n   copy attribute: another attribute, 'source attribute'\n   index: the point number 0, 1, 2...\n   index 0..1: the same, spread from 0 to 1\n   expression: one GLSL expression, 'expression' (below)\n\nIn an expression you can read\n- every attribute the points already have, by name: P, N, Color, Tex, PScale, PartAge... (P.x, P.y, P.z or Color.r for one component)\n- id (this point's number), uCount (how many points), uTime (seconds since play), uBeat, uFrame, uDelta (seconds per frame), uSeed\n- GLSL: sin cos abs fract floor mod mix clamp smoothstep length distance dot normalize pow min max, vec2 / vec3 / vec4(...)\n- noise and random: gnoise(vec3) (-1..1), fbm(vec3, octaves, roughness), curl(vec3), hashi(id, seed) and hash3i(id, seed) (0..1 per point), hash11(x), hash31(vec3); PI, TAU\nOne expression, no ';' or '{'. Its size must match 'components': vec3(...) for 3.\n\nThe chain below: a 40 x 40 grid, Noise moves it, four Attribute PointZ shape the boxes that Instance PointZ puts on every point. Change the expressions and watch the render.
  f width 760
  f height 900
  i fontSize 1
  c color 0.55 0.8 0.95
end
node 2 PointZ Grid PointZ
  uid 2
  pos 0 1536
  flags 1 0 0 0 1 0
  f sizeX 6
  f sizeY 6
  f sizeZ 0
  i rows 40
  i cols 40
  i orient 1
  i kind 2
end
node 3 Compositing Comment
  uid 3
  pos 0 1173
  flags 1 0 0 0 1 0
  s text A grid of 40 x 40 points (output: points), lying flat (orientation XZ).
  f width 380
  f height 90
  i fontSize 1
  c color 0.95 0.85 0.45
end
node 4 PointZ Noise PointZ
  uid 4
  pos 916 383
  flags 1 0 0 0 1 0
  s attrib P
  i type 2
  i mode 0
  f amp 0.5
  f freq 0.6
  b use4d 1
  f speed 0.25
end
node 5 Compositing Comment
  uid 5
  pos 916 0
  flags 1 0 0 0 1 0
  s text Noise PointZ moves P up and down over time: now every point has its own P.y for the expressions after it to use.
  f width 380
  f height 110
  i fontSize 1
  c color 0.95 0.85 0.45
end
node 6 PointZ Attribute PointZ
  uid 6
  pos 1452 473
  flags 1 0 0 0 1 0
  s name PScale
  i comps 1
  i from 4
  s expr 0.4 + abs(P.y) * 3.0
end
node 7 Compositing Comment
  uid 7
  pos 1452 0
  flags 1 0 0 0 1 0
  s text 1  attribute PScale, 1 component, expression:\n0.4 + abs(P.y) * 3.0\n\nThe higher (or lower) the point, the bigger its box. Try length(P.xz) * 0.6: bigger towards the edges.
  f width 420
  f height 200
  i fontSize 1
  c color 0.95 0.85 0.45
end
node 8 PointZ Attribute PointZ
  uid 8
  pos 2028 473
  flags 1 0 0 0 1 0
  s name Scale
  i comps 3
  i from 4
  s expr vec3(1.0, 1.0 + abs(P.y) * 4.0, 1.0)
end
node 9 Compositing Comment
  uid 9
  pos 2028 0
  flags 1 0 0 0 1 0
  s text 2  attribute Scale, 3 components:\nvec3(1.0, 1.0 + abs(P.y) * 4.0, 1.0)\n\nSize per axis: only Y stretches - columns. It multiplies PScale.
  f width 420
  f height 200
  i fontSize 1
  c color 0.95 0.85 0.45
end
node 10 PointZ Attribute PointZ
  uid 10
  pos 2604 473
  flags 1 0 0 0 1 0
  s name Rotate
  i comps 3
  i from 4
  s expr vec3(0.0, hashi(id, 1.0) * 360.0, 0.0)
end
node 11 Compositing Comment
  uid 11
  pos 2604 0
  flags 1 0 0 0 1 0
  s text 3  attribute Rotate, 3 components (degrees X Y Z):\nvec3(0.0, hashi(id, 1.0) * 360.0, 0.0)\n\nA random turn around Y per box. hashi(id, seed) gives each point its own number, the same every frame; change the seed for another pattern.
  f width 420
  f height 200
  i fontSize 1
  c color 0.95 0.85 0.45
end
node 12 PointZ Attribute PointZ
  uid 12
  pos 3180 473
  flags 1 0 0 0 1 0
  s name Color
  i comps 4
  i from 4
  s expr vec4(0.5 + 0.5 * sin(P.x * 2.0 + uTime), 0.35, 0.5 + 0.5 * cos(P.z * 2.0), 1.0)
end
node 13 Compositing Comment
  uid 13
  pos 3180 0
  flags 1 0 0 0 1 0
  s text 4  attribute Color, 4 components (r g b a):\nvec4(0.5 + 0.5 * sin(P.x * 2.0 + uTime), 0.35,\n     0.5 + 0.5 * cos(P.z * 2.0), 1.0)\n\nColour by position, moving with uTime (seconds).
  f width 420
  f height 200
  i fontSize 1
  c color 0.95 0.85 0.45
end
