node 16 Compositing Comment
  uid 16
  pos 3756 0
  flags 1 0 0 0 1 0
  s text Instance PointZ draws the shape on input 2 (a box) at every point of input 1, and per point reads P (where), PScale (size), Scale (size per axis), Rotate (degrees), Color, Active (0 hides it) and N (aim, with 'aim along N'). 'scale' here multiplies them all.
  f width 380
  f height 170
  i fontSize 1
  c color 0.95 0.85 0.45
end
